    <section class="single-product-storyteller -fullbleed site-gutter aside-  " >
        <div class="single-product-storyteller-container img-right">


<div class="prog-load is-img-loading content-img">
<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset ="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_mobile_03.ashx?mh=160&mw=160&hash=F14B3D878EA3DEDA1AA17FE9027D57D0"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_03.ashx?mh=240&mw=240&hash=096B20BC23A02ED3D985528AE8BF40E2"><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_03.ashx?mh=427&mw=320&hash=8E38DA719D6B907F97557E5757AF363E" alt="" /></picture>
<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" data-srcset ="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_mobile_03.ashx?mh=960&mw=960&hash=38CC830DF127D554966A21B56D2336ED"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" data-srcset="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_03.ashx?mh=1440&mw=1440&hash=A74E3CF7BE43193B6868C3D6B1391ABD"><img data-src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_03.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=94D173D641012ACAB42E6CD691A6343A" alt="" /></picture>
</div>

        <div class="text-container">
            <div class="headline">Sorrisi all’infinito  </div>
            <div class="content">
                Kingpin è la nostra sospensione posteriore leggera e pensata per le lunghe distanze; non richiede manutenzione e conferisce al telaio Topstone una vera e propria escursione della ruota posteriore senza compromettere la rigidità per gli sprint. Kingpin garantisce una guida più fluida, maggiore trazione per spingere al massimo e maggiore comodità per affrontare i terreni più accidentati. Non ti accorgerai nemmeno che c'è, ma sarai molto contento di averlo.
            </div>
            
        </div>

        </div>

    </section>
        <div class="spacer   spacer-m-6"></div>
        <div class="spacer spacer-medium  spacer-m-3"></div>


    <section class="single-product-storyteller -fullbleed site-gutter aside-  " >
        <div class="single-product-storyteller-container img-left">


<div class="prog-load is-img-loading content-img">
<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset ="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_mobile_04.ashx?mh=160&mw=160&hash=2D8F0B36FE320947DB563EE549ED80FF"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_04.ashx?mh=240&mw=240&hash=F3BFA4EAA58129349CC6F7946D4C5DBF"><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_04.ashx?mh=427&mw=320&hash=97380222929AF2F7D0C19D182822C98E" alt="" /></picture>
<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" data-srcset ="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_mobile_04.ashx?mh=960&mw=960&hash=09AF49AFEC6E20FC8D9C361CCAF31CB6"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" data-srcset="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_04.ashx?mh=1440&mw=1440&hash=F0AFAF3C88241BBD8E0FE194A37DCFA1"><img data-src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_04.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=E6A30D3803153CD238D47DFA330A3570" alt="" /></picture>
</div>

        <div class="text-container">
            <div class="headline">Portati di tutto </div>
            <div class="content">
                Il nostro nuovo sistema di stoccaggio StashPort nel tubo obliquo è progettato per essere nascosto ma al tempo stesso pratico. Abbinato alla speciale StashBag, puoi portare con te tutto l'essenziale durante il viaggio, sapendo che sarà al sicuro, qualunque cosa tu faccia. Inoltre, i molteplici punti di montaggio sul telaio ti permettono di trasportare più materiale per ulteriori avventure.
            </div>
            
        </div>

        </div>

    </section>
        <div class="spacer spacer-medium  spacer-m-6"></div>


    <section class="single-product-storyteller -fullbleed site-gutter aside-  " >
        <div class="single-product-storyteller-container img-right">


<div class="prog-load is-img-loading content-img">
<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset ="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_mobile_05.ashx?mh=160&mw=160&hash=3F5CDABDCF7298C1EF60150B9DE072BF"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_05.ashx?mh=240&mw=240&hash=8A8CDA861685119D6355DFA9A021A8D0"><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_05.ashx?mh=427&mw=320&hash=231176A0DE183963611C12FC36C8365B" alt="" /></picture>
<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" data-srcset ="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_mobile_05.ashx?mh=960&mw=960&hash=C6834CC019290244F6F3AFEEE71F2183"><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" data-srcset="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_05.ashx?mh=1440&mw=1440&hash=80246EC967A313BCC421885E550C13E9"><img data-src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/carbon/c25_topstonecarbon_pdps_desktop_05.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=BCDFEB314F3FBCAB2336B6A6F185D959" alt="" /></picture>
</div>

        <div class="text-container">
            <div class="headline">Feeling personalizzato </div>
            <div class="content">
                Un feeling di guida-personalizzato, specifico per te. Tradotto: Struttura Proportional Response Tutto, dalla disposizione delle fibre di carbonio alla geometria della Topstone, è regolato individualmente in base alla taglia del telaio, in modo che la bici, sospensioni KingPin incluse, funzioni in armonia per offrirti il miglior feeling di guida possibile per te.
            </div>
            
        </div>

        </div>

    </section>
        <div class="spacer spacer-large  spacer-m-12"></div>
<section class="product-features -fullbleed" id="product-features">
    <div class="product-features__upper">
        <div class="product-features__headline">
            <h2 class="h2 -light">
Caratteristiche            </h2>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel-container">
        <div class="scrollable-content">
            <div class="scrollable-content__lower">
                <div class="scrollable-content__scroller">
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0003.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=E3AF948E89129B1C1C1AFB792EB64E2D" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title">KingPin</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">La nostra innovativa sospensione posteriore è incredibilmente leggera, semplice ed efficace. Un perno passante nel tubo sella consente al carro posteriore e al reggisella della bici di flettersi verticalmente, offrendo fino a 30 mm di escursione per assorbire gli urti senza aggiungere complessità o peso.</p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0025.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=E7B79BF945A95ECCC2650731A0D57719" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title">StashPort + StashBag</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">StashPort è la nostra idea di un sistema di stoccaggio sul tubo obliquo, accessibile sotto il portaborraccia. Ogni bici è dotata di StashBag, una borsa appositamente progettata per contenere gli oggetti essenziali.</p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0028.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=81A7EBAA9A5CB88265C314B1D6B04C28" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title"> Passaggio ruota</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">Tanto spazio per moderni pneumatici da gravel. Il telaio accetta pneumatici larghi fino a 52 mm con una configurazione a singola corona, o 45 mm per una a doppia, mentre la forcella può ospitare pneumatici con una larghezza fino a ben 56 mm. Misure, ovviamente, rilevate dal produttore.</p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0027.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=61E91B4919FB7E5AB1C912FE775CA4E1" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title">Predisposta per reggisella telescopico</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">Questa bicicletta è compatibile con un reggisella telescopico da 27,2 mm dotato di passaggio interno dei cavi, il che non dovrebbe sorprendere su una bici pensata per l'uso fuoristrada.</p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0001.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=80DF2DCD42F75465DEE771856FEC043C" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title">Proportional Response</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">Ottimizzata appositamente per ogni ciclista, la nostra costruzione specifica per ogni taglia garantisce rigidità e comfort ottimali per ogni misura di telaio. In questo modo ogni utilizzatore può trarre vantaggio dalla sensazione di guida ideale e dal comfort offerti da KingPin. </p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0019.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=11D42B3B73334D0E7476C3AB17C71027" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title">Geometria OutFront</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">Stabilità sicura e maneggevolezza agile. Un offset della forcella allungato abbinato ad un angolo sterzo aperto mantengono lo sterzo vivace e facile da condurre, offrendo comunque una sicurezza elevata alle alte velocità e nei terreni sconnessi.  </p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                        <div class="product-features__item -arrow-anchor">
                            <div class="product-features__item__image">

<picture class="multiSourcePicture "><source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset =""><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset=""><img src="https://d1mo5ln9tjltxq.cloudfront.net/-/media/images/my25/bikes/road/gravel/topstone-carbon/pdps/tech-images/c25_topstone_carbon_tech_0015.ashx?mh=2560&mw=1920&hash=53B95D4AF9A75DABCD20B96E6E02B9A7" alt="" /></picture>                            </div>

                            <div class="product-features__item-text">
                                <h3 class="product-features__item__title">Integrazione pulita</h3>
                                <p class="product-features__item__description">Il passaggio interno delle guaine lungo tutto il telaio, abbinato all'attacco manubrio Conceal, donano alla bici un aspetto ordinato e integrato.</p>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                </div>
                <div class="scrollable-content__arrow -left-arrow" data-direction="-1" role="button"></div>
                <div class="scrollable-content__arrow -right-arrow" data-direction="1" role="button"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<span class="spacer" data-h="140"></span>


